post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Webots uses the legacy XInput 1.3 runtime for joystick support.
Windows may already provide XINPUT1_3.dll through the DirectX End-User Runtime.
If Webots reports that XINPUT1_3.dll is missing, install the MSYS2 compatibility
package matching your environment, for example:
  pacman -S mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-xinput1_3
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
